            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR makes several changes to <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;meta name=</code> docs.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The standard metadata names page has a lot of information that's hard to read. This PR tidies up the definition lists by bringing the types out into subpages.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Additions:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>new page for <code class=\"notranslate\">html/reference/attributes/content</code></li>\n<li>new pages for <code class=\"notranslate\">meta name</code> types (mostly extracted from <code class=\"notranslate\">html/reference/elements/meta/name</code>)\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">html/reference/elements/meta/name/color-scheme</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">html/reference/elements/meta/name/referrer</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">html/reference/elements/meta/name/robots</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">html/reference/elements/meta/name/theme-color</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">html/reference/elements/meta/name/viewport</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Modifications:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Short titles for <code class=\"notranslate\">script/type</code> pages</li>\n<li>link to script types and meta names in sidebars</li>\n</ul>",
