        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102389071?u=6c20d668e6652ead837b43f29baef71808a989c6&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added a \"DOM interface\" section to the  SVG element documentation, linking to the SVGPathElement interface.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change clarifies the relationship between the  element and its corresponding DOM interface, helping readers understand how to interact with  elements via JavaScript and find relevant API documentation more easily.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SVGPathElement\" rel=\"nofollow\">SVGPathElement - MDN Web Docs</a> for more information about the interface.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39788.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3117659952\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39788\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39788/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39788\">#39788</a></p>",
