        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR removes info from the PR template.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Currently, it's an information overload when opening a new PR. I expect the more text that's added here, the less likely anyone is to read it.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As an alternative, I would suggest a welcome bot leaves a comment on <strong>first time contributors</strong> PRs with a message that says what to expect, with links to resources.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3094332299\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39707\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/39707/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39707\">#39707</a></li>\n</ul>",
